      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know. it just feels like i'm watching everyone from behind a thick pane of glass. i come back from being somewhere that actually mattered, and now i'm just... drifting through this hollow version of a life. it doesnt even feel real anymore. like i'm already gone and everyone just hasn't noticed yet.",
